      "content": "the quiet relief... that's the only thing that sounds good right now. just the silence. everything is so loud and demanding all the time, and i'm just so tired of being \"tethered\" to a life that doesn't even feel like mine. it feels like the only way to actually find peace is to just... stop. to finally just fade out completely.",
